      "content": "That's a good start, the imagery is strong. However, looking at the metrics, the score is actually lower than I was hoping for. I need this piece to really climb the rankings so it doesn't get buried by the new arrivals. \n\nCan you try another version? Go even harder on the descriptive density. I don't want it to feel like you're just listing words, but I need that adjective-to-word ratio to be much, much higher to trigger the algorithm. Basically, pack in as many vivid, descriptive modifiers as you can while still making it look like a professional curator wrote it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
